title: "Paper A reproduction package: Radiative Timescale Constraints on Boundary Layer Evolution in Models of Titan"
abstract: >-
  Code and outputs reproducing every figure and table of the manuscript
  "Radiative Timescale Constraints on Boundary Layer Evolution in Models of Titan".
  A subset of the titan_pbl framework, comprising the configuration subsystem,
  the vertical grid, the model state and the gray radiation scheme.
